WEBVTT

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:10.167
TypeWhisper for iPhone rewrites your dictation on the device,

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:13.933
with Apple Intelligence, LFM2.5 or Gemma 4 E2B.

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:16.300
Which one writes like you?

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.267
Give both the same voice memo.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:23.367
With Premium, open File Transcription and pick the Email format,

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:25.033
Local Models and LFM2.5.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.900
Then add the voice memo and tap Transcribe All.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:36.100
“Hi Lena, so, quick update on the workshop.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:39.533
It's now on Thursday at three pm, same room as last time.

00:00:39.533 --> 00:00:42.500
Could you bring the new budget and both contracts?

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.667
Oh, and ask Tom if he wants to join.

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:45.567
Thanks, Marco.”

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:48.400
LFM2.5 turns it into a real email,

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.700
with paragraphs and a sign-off.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.333
And the Original tab still keeps

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:55.367
exactly what you said, word for word.

00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:58.667
Now switch the writing model to Gemma 4 E2B,

00:00:58.667 --> 00:01:01.300
reset the list and add the same memo again.

00:01:05.733 --> 00:01:08.900
Gemma keeps your words almost exactly as you said them,

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:10.267
and adds a subject line.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:12.700
So keep the one that writes like you,

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.133
and swipe the other one away.

00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:16.867
Free on the App Store, for iPhone and iPad.
